  "description": "Visual check (B-1290): a PC monitor on Defection (pad_0418, room 144, base:model_pc1), seen from 140 units in front. tvscreenRender read the screen's fourth corner from vertex 3 of a compiled model's flattened node, which is the first corner again, so half of every monitor and TV screen was not drawn (the Carrington Institute computer face of the v0.1.105 reports). The player is placed after the mission's intro and the view is held on the screen (B-1291); the log proves the view with look_dot and the screenshots show the screen whole.",
